{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1d08b310e5561cf5a1bc4bf0ef33cb57e4761c39dbb11e8b5377f73b18321a67","ja":"今日の朋花と真美のお仕事は、屋外でのグラビア撮影。\n前半の撮影は順調に終了し、休憩中のこと……","zh":"今天朋花和真美的工作是室外凹版写真拍摄。\n前半段的拍摄顺利结束，就在休息时……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ec5cf75e982fb9e764197cf093db4123a51b350d85c6df0cdb502744933ba424","ja":"朋花様！　目線ちょ～だいっ☆","zh":"朋花大人！看这边嘛～☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"95e8c2beca06a3d182e073f390f7369ff8385339c25d6e5b5e5b43a4204baaef","ja":"カシャッ！","zh":"咔嚓！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"eae8b7493fbcafecfd0b7953e2e4af63108c277dbb3c545e34b0087daa864744","ja":"どうしたのです～、いきなり……？\n……ああ、SNS用の写真ですね～？","zh":"怎么了吗～，这么突然……？\n……啊，是要拍发社交平台的照片对吧～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"81fad8371e292fdeb9dd8ad9f207d76a1b3244a97bf07f792b054776b62e66ea","ja":"そだよ～！　さっそく投稿しちゃうね。\n「#オフショット　#撮影頑張ってるよ」っと♪","zh":"就是说嘛～！这就发出去哦。\n“#花絮照　#拍摄中努力加油哦”♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"42b799e1c67661637ab9740ad023b7c4fe1c0e6a0dccdee1d7e4bf1476460d1d","ja":"真美ちゃん、とてもマメに更新してますよね～。\n素敵な心がけです～。","zh":"真美很勤快地在更新呢～。\n这种心态真棒～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"fe09616dcc49e9647cf739ea81445586e9c2f2dca754b564bea27d42f62134b1","ja":"いや～、みんなが真美の投稿を待ってるからね～♪\n人気者はつらいよ～♪","zh":"哎呀～，因为大家都在等着真美的投稿嘛～♪\n人气高可真是辛苦呀～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"96503ec917887e4fbf0196ab3cf0b41639df0a4ffe147bf453db4a88836dd99a","ja":"あっ！　さっきの写真に、もうコメントきたよ！\n「朋花ちゃんに魔法をかけられたい！」だって♪","zh":"啊！刚才发的照片，已经有评论了哦！\n说是“想被朋花施加魔法！”呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"6fc4f062797e2e1392a248a2e41cc307a64ad5d5f81a7c1aca5b6c8498b976c8","ja":"うふふ。そうですか～。この子豚ちゃんは\nどんな魔法をかけてほしいのでしょうね～？","zh":"呵呵呵。是这样啊～。这只小猪仔\n希望被施下什么样的魔法呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7d2ef0525243179871d1a7b1e286b8e664f838dc65548eef13e1ff2b006660c1","ja":"あははっ。なんか朋花様がそう言うと、\nホントに魔法をかけてくれちゃいそうだね！","zh":"啊哈哈。总觉得朋花大人这么一说，\n真的会为我们施下魔法呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e25ff4b36b97af18e094a3b688b57bfa77bbf126b8f3aff41cdc4d66b000a8de","ja":"ふふふ……真美ちゃんには、\n私がそう見えるんですね～。","zh":"呵呵呵……在真美眼里，\n我看起来是那样的呀～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2e748e911620941b6a4aa527e7f3c916ee463850e4120daa333801fd0da24ddd","ja":"うん！　なにせ朋花様だかんね！","zh":"嗯！毕竟那可是朋花大人啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ecaa50eb064002986976bb36555251b38b2574eaa0e8b9d48badbb263f0e1e69","ja":"実は聖なる魔法を使う……なんて秘密があっても\nおかしくないっしょ～。","zh":"就算其实掌握着神圣魔法……这样的小秘密，\n也很说得过去吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1101.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"8ce3a3878b9032486245d649c67b1407454a7ddf52fab78c109ab2a634e4a93f","ja":"そうですか～……。\nバレてしまっては、仕方ありませんね～……。","zh":"这样啊～……。\n既然被发现了，那就没办法了呢～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
